# ONEINPUT：提交文本在交付前被截断到首字符（:1440-1443）。投 5 ⇒ RESULT=5。
# 这条同时钉住 oneInput 截断位（不是先按整串解析再截断）。
case: oneinput
target: REPLAY_ONEINPUT
anchor: reference/emuera-cs/MinorShift.Emuera.GameProc.Function/FunctionIdentifier.cs:915-957
anchor: reference/emuera-cs/MinorShift.Emuera.GameView/EmueraConsole.cs:1440-1443
--- inputs
submit 5
--- expect-console
START-ONEINPUT
ONEINPUT=5
END-ONEINPUT
--- expect-vars
RESULT:0 = 5
